*replace* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''replace(haystack, needle, replacement)''

Replaces all occurrences of a substring with another string.

*Parameters:*
- ''haystack'': String to search in
- ''needle'': String to search for
- ''replacement'': String to replace with

*Returns:*
- String: String with all occurrences replaced

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if haystack is not a string
- Runtime error if needle is not a string
- Runtime error if replacement is not a string
- Runtime error if needle is empty
